From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bryan O'Donoghue <bryan.odonoghue@linaro.org>
Date: Mon, 16 Mar 2026 01:02:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] UBUNTU: SAUCE: media: qcom: camss: Drop legacy PHY
 descriptions from x1e

BugLink: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2144643

x1e is the first CAMSS SoC to use the new PHY interface. Drop the redundant
legacy CSIPHY descriptions.

Reviewed-by: Christopher Obbard <christopher.obbard@linaro.org>
Tested-by: Christopher Obbard <christopher.obbard@linaro.org>
Signed-off-by: Bryan O'Donoghue <bryan.odonoghue@linaro.org>
Signed-off-by: Tobias Heider <tobias.heider@canonical.com>
Signed-off-by: Paolo Pisati <paolo.pisati@canonical.com>
Ledger-Change: C-00279
Ledger-Origin: ubuntu@b538a6bb6c461e1b84d0b602310908ef9f8136a8
---
 drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss.c | 37 -----------------------
 1 file changed, 37 deletions(-)

